WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:03,580
Yun Xi, please register the newcomer’s abilities.

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:04,700
Susheng, you understand this

3
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,260
Arrange everyone’s accommodation and division of labor

4
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:07,300
I went out to look for supplies

5
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,460
Brother Chang

6
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,740
You have an attacking ability

7
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:11,940
Stay and protect everyone.

8
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:17,940
Ah, my superpower

9
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,300
Can put objects in the mouth

10
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:22,880
Big, big fall

11
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,760
This can be considered a space attack ability, right?

12
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:27,040
I'm worried that I can't find the gold box for space powers.

13
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,360
The value of this girl

14
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:31,190
what is your name

15
00:00:31,190 --> 00:00:33,110
Why did you decide to stay?

16
00:00:33,110 --> 00:00:35,340
My name is Zhu Jiao and I am timid.

17
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:37,260
Don't dare, don't dare live by yourself outside

18
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:39,500
The superpower has no effect even if it goes out

19
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,900
I don't know who to go to either

20
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:42,780
Moreover, I have a big appetite

21
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:45,060
The food at home is not enough for me for a few days
